---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Get access"
  description="Hyphos is in design-partner stage — we're shaping a small cohort of pilots before opening self-serve access."
>
  <section class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-20 px-4 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-grid opacity-30" />
    <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px]" />

    <div class="relative w-full max-w-xl text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-6">
        Design partners cohort · limited
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-5">
        Self-serve isn't open yet — by design.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
        Hyphos sits inside the work of real engagements, and pricing is shaped to the engagement rather than to a per-seat tier. We're running this stage as a small cohort of design partners — consulting firms and project teams on complex builds — and shape each pilot directly with the team.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed mb-10">
        If your firm runs complex projects and you'd benefit from apprenticing your team in the craft of the work itself, write to us. We reply personally.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mb-10">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white hover:bg-indigo-500 transition-all glow-indigo"
        >
          Talk about a pilot
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:info@hyphos.io"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-white/20 transition-all"
        >
          info@hyphos.io
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
        Already on a pilot? <a href="/login" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 underline decoration-indigo-500/40 underline-offset-4">Sign in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
